#{[{:activity/expected-seconds 1140.0 :activity/first-step {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055656} :activity/id #uuid "0c86ff1c-1fc9-55e7-bf07-5e59726ce644" :activity/scope {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049520 :topic/id #uuid "fc088d7c-dbfc-5873-80cb-82bec1e45e30" :topic/math-academy-id 85} :activity/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055656 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055936 :tutorial/content "The **greatest common factor** (or ![](images/86/861891fd828ee3558330774b23f5dcee69976d8f302da6f1e6825bf3b4be47e6.svg)) of ![](images/f5/f5a17e5e4e88d2fd8eed0ac09f0e02d77507121fac42d5f696cf407aaab6185c.svg) and ![](images/2f/2fd89ffbc3140e9c2f12576c1dec2522d603c45e8b1d4128c02892f651c6e6bb.svg) is the largest expression that will divide *both* ![](images/f5/f5a17e5e4e88d2fd8eed0ac09f0e02d77507121fac42d5f696cf407aaab6185c.svg) and ![](images/2f/2fd89ffbc3140e9c2f12576c1dec2522d603c45e8b1d4128c02892f651c6e6bb.svg) with no remainder.\n\nTo find the GCF, we list the factors of the coefficients and then identify any variable factors the expressions have in common.\n\nThe factors of ![](images/f5/f5a17e5e4e88d2fd8eed0ac09f0e02d77507121fac42d5f696cf407aaab6185c.svg) are\n![](images/05/05dbff97b169f70d1dd03beb2c23670b48520c5d98a839d218db50a06518fbf6.svg)\n\nThe factors of ![](images/34/34d666f013d8ce4f2b50c0a9ab9c2b5808feb37163ba38470555867babada4ef.svg) are\n![](images/59/59919e2659e3bb232e4dbc1857c9f0eca27706bbad72aea6a55bb749706307a2.svg)\n\nThe common factors of ![](images/f5/f5a17e5e4e88d2fd8eed0ac09f0e02d77507121fac42d5f696cf407aaab6185c.svg) and ![](images/34/34d666f013d8ce4f2b50c0a9ab9c2b5808feb37163ba38470555867babada4ef.svg) are\n![](images/b0/b08502484874a42582d63ddfc0eda0048576d0cc460aced250ad962721d0e985.svg)\n\nThe greatest of these common factors is ![](images/fe/fe34f715005da1a8b682c9650a76785673fdf25c3b7c7546bb94824470c54caf.svg)\n\nNow we look at the variable factors. Since ![](images/f5/f5a17e5e4e88d2fd8eed0ac09f0e02d77507121fac42d5f696cf407aaab6185c.svg) has no variable and ![](images/2f/2fd89ffbc3140e9c2f12576c1dec2522d603c45e8b1d4128c02892f651c6e6bb.svg) contains ![](images/5a/5aac2c81021f3f9e468e7840c5f95ece35c10b894bdae19ec1d247bdeb47ac6f.svg) there are no variable factors in common.\n\nThus, the greatest common factor of ![](images/f5/f5a17e5e4e88d2fd8eed0ac09f0e02d77507121fac42d5f696cf407aaab6185c.svg) and ![](images/2f/2fd89ffbc3140e9c2f12576c1dec2522d603c45e8b1d4128c02892f651c6e6bb.svg) is ![](images/fe/fe34f715005da1a8b682c9650a76785673fdf25c3b7c7546bb94824470c54caf.svg)" :tutorial/id #uuid "b2b71877-6097-5d59-a2b8-7440bd0d5329" :tutorial/math-academy-id 1360 :tutorial/title "Introduction"} :step/id #uuid "c78d0b7d-678e-5655-a213-713eadefdc2c" :step/math-academy-id 629467 :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055657}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055657 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054687 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054588 :question/id #uuid "6ce77198-a3b2-5e9b-98d5-db8922addc1a" :question/math-academy-id "e-816"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "92176bb0-84dc-5fa4-8154-e974c05fff06" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049540} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186051009}] :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055262} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055400} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186459236} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186459247}] :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Greatest Common Factor of a Number and a Variable Expression"} :step/id #uuid "ed6a9f50-301e-58d1-8a60-afe81d9aaa27" :step/math-academy-id 629468 :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055658}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055658 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054688 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054589 :question/id #uuid "f4d78520-1050-5ca1-a2da-1b813269dd9d" :question/math-academy-id "e-817"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "01ac1e8c-128c-5c13-b845-105092ae74d6" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055263} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055265} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186459211} {:db